  "summaries": [
    {
      "id": 355093,
      "category": "team",
      "content": "A vulnerability was discovered that allowed comments on draft reports to be sent to a program's Slack workspace. This could potentially expose confidential information from draft reports. The issue was reported by @imranhudaa and validated by HackerOne. A fix was implemented so that activities from draft reports are no longer posted to Slack. HackerOne thanks the reporter for responsibly disclosing this issue.",
